  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating the Just Transition of Sri Lanka&#x2019;s Agriculture Sector Towards Net-Zero Pathways</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka has been grappling with a multidimensional crisis, marked by economic instability, climate vulnerabilities, and socio-political challenges. The countrys recent economic downturn has exacerbated poverty levels, particularly among marginalized groups such as plantation workers and smallholder farmers. These communities, already facing historical inequities, are disproportionately affected by rising costs of living, lack of access to essential services, and the impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
